5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a sustainable system. I think we should start by gathering some data to see where the gaps are. Let's decide what we need to investigate.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We need a rational basis for the new arrangement. I'm interested in the actual time required for cleaning and how the previous tenants handled it.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A rational basis is indeed essential. To ensure the burden is distributed fairly, I believe we should examine the actual usage of the space and how we currently define a ""clean"" room.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm with you all on the data part. I just want to stop the guessing game of whether the rooms are actually clean or not. Let's figure out what ""done"" really means for everyone.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree that harmony is the most important thing here. To make sure we're all on the same page and feeling fair, I'd like to see what the previous tenants did and the house chat records.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It seems we have a general consensus on the need for data. To ensure the financial side is transparent, I will look into the management office rate sheet and billing, as well as the bathroom spray stock and receipts.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the note left by the previous tenants. I want to be certain about the actual time commitment involved.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"To complement the time and cost data, I shall examine a fortnight's watch on kitchen use and what each housemate counts as done. It would be prudent to align our expectations with actual usage.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'll take a look at the bathroom grout after the July scrub and the rows recorded in the house chat. I want to see exactly where things are falling apart.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I think those are all very helpful choices. To help us find a balanced solution, I'll look into the note left by the previous tenants and the absences on the wall calendar.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have all selected our areas of investigation, I believe we have a comprehensive list. Let's proceed with the research so we can discuss the findings in the next round.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,That seems efficient. I will focus on the timing and the previous tenants' notes to see if there is a discrepancy between perceived and actual effort. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A little empirical evidence should save us from the tedious cycle of assumptions. I shall see if our habits align with our expectations. I look forward to our subsequent analysis.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm just as excited as you guys. Let's hope the data actually gives us some answers so I can stop holding my breath every time I open the bathroom door!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I hope so too, May! Let's all try to keep an open mind when we share what we find. I'm looking forward to finding a way that makes everyone feel comfortable and happy.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let's maintain a neutral perspective when reviewing the data. I will begin my investigation into the costs and supplies immediately. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will do the same. I'll ensure the timing is precise so we have a reliable baseline for the workload. See you all soon.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall commence my observations as well. Precision in our data will certainly make the eventual negotiation far more elegant. Until then, I wish you all a productive search.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm on it! I'll dive into those chat logs and the grout situation. Let's see if we can finally turn this place into a sanctuary instead of a gamble. See you all later!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'll get started on my part too. I really hope we can find a solution that keeps us all smiling. Good luck everyone, see you in the next round!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
