60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Given the inefficiency of our current spending and the risk of interpersonal conflict, Option B is the most logical. It removes the burden of labor and provides a clear, professional standard of cleanliness.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option B is the most rational choice. It eliminates the hour-plus time burden and avoids the permanent divisions that ruined the previous tenants' relationships. The financial cost is a fair trade for guaranteed time and peace.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"While Option B is certainly the most elegant in terms of conflict avoidance, it does not address the underlying imbalance of usage. However, compared to the rigidity of A or C, it is the most sustainable.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"I'm voting for Option B! I can't deal with the mold lottery anymore, and I'm definitely over the nagging. Let's just pay the pros to make it sparkle so we can actually enjoy living here.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,I'm also voting for Option B. It seems like the best way to avoid the fighting and resentment we're worried about. Let's prioritize our friendship and peace of mind over the cost!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since we are all leaning toward Option B, we must establish a strict protocol for the invoice. We need a shared ledger to track the monthly payments and supply costs to ensure no one is left out of pocket.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, that is a necessary addition. If we are to commit to this for a year, a transparent ledger prevents financial disputes from replacing the cleaning disputes. I am fully in favor of Option B.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur. While I still find the disparity in usage a curious detail, the pragmatic benefit of a professional standard outweighs the desire for a perfectly proportional labor split. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, finally! I'm glad you've come around to the practical side of things. I'm 100% on board with Option B. Let's just get this sorted so I can stop stressing about the bathroom!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm so glad we've all found something we can agree on! It feels like a weight has been lifted. I'll happily support the ledger idea too, as long as it keeps things friendly. I vote for Option B!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It is settled then. I will take the lead in setting up the ledger for the cleaning service and supplies. This will ensure that all payments are tracked and settled promptly every month.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I appreciate you taking that on, Toshio. Having a reliable system for the finances is the only way to make Option B sustainable. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we have reached a consensus, I shall cast my vote for Option B. It is a sophisticated solution that replaces domestic friction with a predictable expense. I look forward to the newfound tranquility.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"I'm voting for Option B too! I'm just so relieved we're actually doing this. Now, can we please call the cleaners before the bathroom decides to grow its own ecosystem?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm voting for Option B as well! I'm just so happy we're all agreeing and staying friends. Let's make this work and enjoy our home together!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I vote for Option B. With the ledger in place, we can finally eliminate both the cleaning disputes and the financial ambiguity. I will ensure the billing is handled with complete transparency.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for Option B. It is the only choice that realistically protects our time and prevents the social decay we saw in the previous tenants. I am satisfied with this decision.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I vote for Option B. It is a pragmatic compromise that preserves our harmony, even if it leaves the mystery of our kitchen habits unsolved. I look forward to the silence of a clean house.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,"I vote for Option B! Finally, a decision that actually solves the problem. I'm looking forward to a bathroom that doesn't make me want to run away. Let's get this started!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Midori,,I vote for Option B! I'm so relieved we've found a way to keep our home clean and our friendships strong. Thank you everyone for being so open and understanding!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
